    <td style="color:#223388; font-size:150%; vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:black; font-weight:600">NIST Atomic Spectra Database Levels Data</span><p>
      <sup></sup>Ne  IX &nbsp;&nbsp;110 Levels Found<br />
<b><font size="+1"><i>Z</i> = 10, He isoelectronic sequence</font></b><span style="font-size=300%">&nbsp;</span></p>
